# Two real offline static scans, one labeled seeded decision, one TUI decision.
name: Review finishes at Report with source uncertainty and reading state intact
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_report.py prepare @TMP_TARGET @ART/fixture
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/fixture/open-pending.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 F-0002 · needs_review | pending-review
expect: review 1 remaining findings (2 total)
expect-not: Prove ○
expect-not: Fix ×
submit: decision deferred Offline TUI review fixture
require-live-snap: 30 open Report | review-complete
expect: review decisions are recorded
expect-not: remaining actionable findings
ask: Does recording the final decision clearly offer Report without suggesting proof or patch work?
nav-mode:
keys: Z
require-live-snap: 20 ZOOM SELECTED FINDING | focused-review
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 Enter export | report-from-review
expect: 2 findings · 2 reviewed · 1 confirmed
expect: Workspace spend: total unavailable
ask: Can the operator understand what will be exported, where it goes, and what cost information is missing?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 ZOOM SELECTED FINDING | report-return
expect: Offline TUI review fixture
ask: Does Report return to the same focused finding without losing the decision or zoom?
submit: next
require-live-snap: 30 Enter export | next-opens-report
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | report-80
ask: Are export controls and selected format readable at 80x24?
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 REPORT | report-60
ask: Is the report usable at 60x20 with honest scrolling and return controls?
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 REPORT | report-40
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 .kuzushi/reports/findings.json | report-40-paged
ask: Can a keyboard operator reach the destination and export controls at 40x12?
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | report-tall
ask: Does the tall layout retain a clear hierarchy without implying that absent findings were fixed?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | report-wide
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 EXPORTED | exported
expect: findings.json
expect: SESSION COST
ask: Does the export receipt show the actual destination and outcome without launching more work?
shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_report.py verify @TMP_TARGET @ART/fixture
keys: C-c
resize: 120x36
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restart
submit: next
require-live-snap: 30 Enter export | report-after-restart
expect: 2 findings · 2 reviewed · 1 confirmed
ask: After restart without color, do the persisted decisions still lead directly to Report?
keys: C-c
